### **Technical Breakdown Dashboard**
├── index.html   # Main application shell, DOM HUD layers, CSS styling
├── mat4.js      # Column-major matrix math array operations
├── track.js     # Authoritative multi-row level layout array maps
└── main.js      # GL context builder, game logic, custom GLSL pipelines


### **Local Pipeline Stack**
[User Inputs] ──> [Deterministic Physics State Loop]
│
├──> [Custom Mat4 Transform Matrix Generation]
│
└──> [WebGL2 Buffers] ──> [GLSL Custom Vertex/Fragment Shaders]


